<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-DI RENZO WINS 11TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DI RENZO WINS 11TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>SALAMANCA, Spain 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marco di Renzo of Italy won the 11th stage of the Tour of Spain over 197 kilometres between Avila and Salamanca on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
